@DGC.Sample.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:5288
@ApiVersion = 2026-02-05
@IdempotencyKey = sample-azure-queue-publish-001

### Create order
POST {{DGC.Sample.Api_HostAddress}}/orders?api-version={{ApiVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{IdempotencyKey}}

{
	"customerName": "Contoso Ltd",
	"orderDateUtc": "2026-02-21T08:30:00Z",
	"status": 1,
	"totalAmount": 2500.00
}

### Publish existing order to Azure queue transport for Function processing
# Replace {orderId} with the created order id from the previous request response.
POST {{DGC.Sample.Api_HostAddress}}/orders/{orderId}/publish-azure?api-version={{ApiVersion}}&queueName=orders
Idempotency-Key: sample-azure-queue-publish-002
